ubturbo (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add 68 new patches (0004-0071): bugfix, refactor, feat, smap, DT/UT
  * Refactor debian/rules patch application: replace per-patch if/fi
    blocks with a while-read loop over debian/patches/series
  * Key changes in new patches:
    - fix: rmrs pidInfos numa_map, memsize calculation, 4k bug, pid,
      CPU tracking, page_flags bugfix, DMA/LD-ST switching, swap bugs
    - refactor: rename CalcRemoteBorrowPages→MBToPage,
      CalTmpBorrowPage→CalAvailPage, multiple function refactor+log
    - feat: exclude MIG_MEMSIZE_MODE processes, calibration mechanism,
      zero-local-freq trigger, queue_delayed_work_on CPU,
      auto-remove migrated-back processes, SMAP migration period
    - smap: restrict grouped strategy to swap, compensate swap imbalance,
      tighten grouped swap trigger, protect sync migrate-out,
      supplement DT tests for iomem/accessed_bit/migrate_pages
    - ubdma: support local memory pages, page-pin bugfix, DT tests
    - doc: update speccpu-gcc-best.cfg, performance testing guide

